          "verdict": "If anyone can, Bannan can beat domeitalycoach 38-37",
          "standfirst": "Liverpool's Dominik Szoboszlai was a domeitalycoach reserve, so the six points from his assist did not count, while Doku's two in the eleven did.",
          "paragraphs": [
            "That assist came in Liverpool's 3-1 win at Crystal Palace, where Liverpool's Florian Wirtz had a goal and an assist of his own for domeitalycoach. Fulham's Timothy Castagne played for them against If anyone can, Bannan can, the side who drafted him.",
